              "text": "باحث — bāḥith — \"a researcher\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "يعمل الباحث في الجامعة منذ سنوات. yaʿmalu al-bāḥith fī al-jāmiʿa mundhu sanawāt. The researcher has worked at the university for years."
